The guest's own suspend: KVM_CAP_ARM_SYSTEM_SUSPEND brings the guest's PSCI SYSTEM_SUSPEND to crosvm, which
sets the vCPU up for the resume entry, parks it as `crosvm suspend` does and asks mothershipd for vm.sleep;
`crosvm resume` wakes the guest at its resume entry.

